  "rootCause": {
    "graphics": "API36.1 GoldfishMapper::readFromHost requires ANDROID_EMU_read_color_buffer_dma. Default local emulator negotiation lacked it even though the image GLDMA flag was on. Host advertises readback only with both direct-memory and shared-slots allocator features; explicit GLDirectMem and HasSharedSlotsHostMemoryAllocator provide them. Renderer choice alone does not.",
    "detector": "Sticky boot plus short process stability admitted a runtime before its delayed mapper abort; absence of the required host extension was not checked.",
    "guestStorage": "Host AVD space checks omit free space inside inherited userdata. The original owned read-only copy had only4572KiB available in/data and Java SQLiteFullException/code13; current admission requires512MiB and refuses unmeasured space.",
    "supportingSourceScope": "Official pinned source explains the measured feature relationship; it is not proof that those exact commits built the installed binary."
